            "review_title": "Review at Insalata Vietnam",
            "review_text": "Hiro\n136 contributions\n1\nTasty Salad Within Walking Distance From Bui Vien\nSep 2019 • Friends\nIt's a hidden cozy salad joint almost within walking distance from Bui Vien. I had chicken teriyaki rice bowl and avocado salad. The eringi mushroom in the salad was so juicy and rich in flavour. Broccolis came with teriyaki chicken were fresh and quite generous in portion. Price is quite reasonable give its quality and ambience. Staff were friendly too. So if you are looking for something healthy and tasty, this place would be good for you.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 27, 2019",
