            "review_title": "Review at Insalata Vietnam",
            "review_text": "roisin l\n13 contributions\n0\nDidn’t put listed ingredients in salad\nApr 2019 • Solo\nI ordered this for takeaway and got the salmon salad but there was no potato, broccoli or asparagus like listed on the menu, so I got a bowel of lettuce and a small bit of salmon. they also gave me sweet chili sauce instead of sesame without asking\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 24, 2019\nInsalata Vietnam\nDear Ms. Roisin,\n\nAs your feedback, the salad which has potatoes, broccoli and asparagus is Salmon Teriyaki with Sesame Sauce. However, the picture you have taken is Grilled Salmon Salad with Sweet and Chilli Sauce. Therefore, I believe there is some misunderstandings about this. We will work this problem out with our staffs again and sincerely apologize for this bad experience that you had. Besides, all the ingredients are always measured before shipping out; hence, the salmon might look a bit small but we assure it's enough quantity for each portion. We hope to have another chance to bring you better service for your next time orders.\n\nSincerely,\nRead more\nWritten April 26, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
