            "review_text": "louise690\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nWonderful salad, lovely miso sashimi sushi ^^\nDec 2018 • Solo\nInsalta is a great choice that help me to get away from all the \"fat\" and \"toxic\" food I have consumed in the week. I feel cool down and happy whenever I have their meal. Love their salmon teriyaki salad in every bite.\n\nSince the first time I started to eat salads at Insalata, I feel more healthy and refreshing. It actually encourages me to eat \"clean\" and more healthy food everyday. They have varied choices of toppings which even greater for me to eat everyday.\nRead more\nWritten January 13, 2019\nInsalata Vietnam\nDear Louise690,\n\nThank you so much for your feedback. We are always happy to be at your service and bring out good feelings for you. \n\nSincerely,\nRead more\nWritten April 26, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
